        "content": "## 🧠 Vector Store (Pinecone)\n\nThis memory tool lets the AI agent search your brand database to give accurate, on-brand replies.\n\n### What to add:\n- Product info\n- How-to guides\n- Benefits\n- Policies (refunds, shipping)\n- FAQs or common issues\n\nEach entry should have:\n- A unique ID\n- A short text block (1–3 paragraphs)\n\n### How it works:\nWhen a user asks a question, the agent looks in this vector store (via semantic search) to find relevant info — then uses it to answer properly.\n\n> Keeps replies consistent, smart, and always on-brand — without overloading the prompt.",
